<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Indresh Tiwari - Senior Power BI Developer</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #fff;
            color: #222;
            line-height: 1.28;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }

        .container {
            width: 21cm;
            margin: 20px auto;
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 0.4in;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Header */
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #2E74B5;
            padding-bottom: 3px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .name {
            font-size: 20pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #000;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .title {
            font-size: 11pt;
            color: #2E74B5;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .contact-info {
            font-size: 9pt;
            color: #444;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .contact-item {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .contact-item a {
            color: #444;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        /* Sections */
        .section-title {
            color: #2E74B5;
            font-size: 11pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
            margin-top: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            padding-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .section-content {
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .summary {
            text-align: justify;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        /* Skills */
        .skills-row {
            display: flex;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .skill-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-right: 8px;
            min-width: 110px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        /* Experience */
        .job-block {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .job-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 10.2pt;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .company-role {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #000;
        }

        .role-highlight {
            color: #2E74B5;
        }

        .date-location {
            font-size: 9.5pt;
            color: #666;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        ul {
            margin: 0 0 0 16px;
            padding: 0;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 1px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        /* Education & Certs merged */
        .edu-cert-block {
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        /* ATS Hidden */
        .ats-hidden {
            color: white;
            font-size: 0px;
            line-height: 0;
            height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: none; /* Hide from Word */
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="name">INDRESH TIWARI</div>
            <div class="title">Senior Power BI Developer / Business Analyst</div>
            <div class="contact-info">
                <span class="contact-item">
                    <a href="mailto:indreshtiwa@gmail.com">indreshtiwa@gmail.com</a>
                </span> |
                <span class="contact-item">
                    <a href="tel:+919926001335">+91-9926001335</a>
                </span> |
                <span class="contact-item">
                    Pune, India
                </span> |
                <span class="contact-item">
                    <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/indreshtiwari" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>
                </span> |
                <span class="contact-item">
                    <a href="https://indreshanalytics.github.io/Portfolio_V2/" target="_blank">Portfolio</a>
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Profile -->
        <div class="section-title">Professional Profile</div>
        <div class="section-content summary">
            Results-driven Senior Power BI Developer and Business Analyst specializing in End-to-End BI Solution
            Architecture. Expert in managing the full data lifecycle—from gathering raw business requirements to
            deploying scalable Power BI datasets. Proven track record of orchestrating complex ETL pipelines using SQL
            and Alteryx, reducing reporting latency by 40%, and leading successful UAT phases for global enterprise
            stakeholders.
        </div>

        <!-- Skills -->
        <div class="section-title">Technical Skills</div>
        <div class="section-content">
            <div class="skills-row">
                <span class="skill-label">BI & Analysis:</span>
                <span>Power BI, DAX, Power Query, Tableau, Business Analysis, Requirement Gathering, UAT.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="skills-row">
                <span class="skill-label">Engineering:</span>
                <span>SQL Server, Alteryx, Python, Data Modeling (Star Schema), ETL Automation.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="skills-row">
                <span class="skill-label">Cloud/AI:</span>
                <span>Azure, Jira, GitHub, Figma, ChatGPT, Copilot.</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Experience -->
        <div class="section-title">Professional Experience</div>
        <div class="section-content">
            <!-- Quauto -->
            <div class="job-block">
                <div class="job-header">
                    <span class="company-role"><span class="role-highlight">Senior Power BI Developer / Business
                            Analyst</span> | Quauto Technologies</span>
                    <span class="date-location">Aug 2023 – Present | Remote</span>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Requirement Gathering & Analysis:</strong> Executed the initial discovery phase,
                        collaborating directly with clients to translate vague business goals into precise technical
                        specifications and KPI definitions.</li>
                    <li><strong>Solution Architecture & Modeling:</strong> Designed and implemented scalable
                        <strong>Star Schema data models</strong> (optimizing Facts and Dimensions) to support
                        high-performance reporting on large-scale enterprise datasets.
                    </li>
                    <li><strong>ETL Orchestration:</strong> Built and maintained robust backend data pipelines using
                        <strong>MS SQL and Alteryx</strong>, automating the extraction, transformation, and loading of
                        data from disparate sources.
                    </li>
                    <li><strong>Advanced Development:</strong> Developed 10+ interactive dashboards using complex
                        <strong>DAX measures</strong>, Calculation Groups, and Row-Level Security (RLS) to ensure data
                        granularity and security.
                    </li>
                    <li><strong>Performance Optimization:</strong> Optimized SQL queries and Power BI dataset refresh
                        schedules, successfully reducing report latency by 40% and improving render times.</li>
                    <li><strong>UAT & Deployment:</strong> Managed the End-to-End <strong>User Acceptance Testing
                            (UAT)</strong> lifecycle, iterating on dashboard features based on stakeholder feedback
                        before final production deployment.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Capgemini Sr -->
            <div class="job-block">
                <div class="job-header">
                    <span class="company-role"><span class="role-highlight">Sr. Analyst / Software Engineer</span> |
                        Capgemini</span>
                    <span class="date-location">Jan 2023 – Aug 2023 | Pune</span>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Legacy Migration:</strong> Executed the technical transition of legacy reporting systems
                        to modern <strong>Cloud-based BI architectures</strong> using SQL and Power BI, ensuring zero
                        downtime.</li>
                    <li><strong>Data Standardization:</strong> Implemented standard global data protocols for
                        high-volume transactional databases using <strong>Advanced SQL</strong>, ensuring consistency
                        across regional reporting units.</li>
                    <li><strong>Pipeline Scalability:</strong> Contributed to the migration of on-premise data marts to
                        <strong>Azure Cloud</strong>, creating scalable data pipelines that support enterprise-level
                        reporting.
                    </li>
                    <li><strong>Stakeholder Collaboration:</strong> Acted as a bridge between technical engineering
                        teams and non-technical business units to ensure alignment on data definitions.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Capgemini Jr -->
            <div class="job-block">
                <div class="job-header">
                    <span class="company-role"><span class="role-highlight">Analyst / Software Engineer</span> |
                        Capgemini</span>
                    <span class="date-location">Jun 2021 – Dec 2022 | Pune</span>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Data Governance:</strong> Engineered <strong>SQL-based data governance
                            workflows</strong> that eliminated manual redundancy and improved overall data integrity by
                        30%.</li>
                    <li><strong>Compliance Automation:</strong> Automated the extraction and validation of sensitive
                        user transactional data using <strong>SQL Scripts</strong>, ensuring compliance with strict data
                        protection standards.</li>
                    <li><strong>Operational Reporting:</strong> Developed and maintained 6-7 critical operational
                        dashboards using <strong>Power BI</strong>, tracking key performance indicators (KPIs) for
                        internal efficiency.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Education & Certs merged -->
        <div class="section-title">Education & Certifications</div>
        <div class="section-content">
            <div class="job-header">
                <strong>BE in CSE</strong> | Bansal Institute of Science & Technology | 2020
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 10.5pt; margin-top: 4px;">
                <strong>Certifications:</strong> Microsoft Certified: Fabric Analytics Engineer Associate (DP-600) [In
                Progress] | Alteryx Designer Core | HackerRank SQL.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
